  <link:footnoteLink xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/link" xlink:type="extended">
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-1" id="fn-1" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:115%">The average of the beginning and end of year balance of $5,839,986 is used when reference is to page 111, line 57, column c in our formula rate tariff.</span>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-2" id="fn-2" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="text-align:justify">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">The 13-month average of Proprietary Capital of $1,821,204,635 is used as the balance when reference is to page 112, line 16, column c in our formula rate tariff.</span>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-3" id="fn-3" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="text-align:justify">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">The 13-month average of Long-Term Debt of $1,214,130,769 is used as the balance when reference is to page 112, sum of line 18, column c through line 21, column c in our formula rate tariff.</span>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-4" id="fn-4" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="text-align:justify">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">For the year ended December 31, 2025 we recorded Debits to account 403.1 totaling $1,703 and Credits of the same amount to account 108.&#160; Additionally, we recorded Credits to account 403.1 totaling $1,703 and Debits of the same amount to account 182.3 in order to defer the total depreciation on the Asset Retirement Cost asset which results in account 403.1 showing a balance of $0.</span>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-5" id="fn-5" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="text-align:justify">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">For the year ended December 31, 2025 we recorded Debits to account 411.10 totaling $77,020 and Credits of the same amount to account 230.&#160; Additionally, we recorded Credits to account 411.10 totaling $77,020 and Debits of the same amount to account 182.3 in order to defer the total depreciation on the Asset Retirement Cost asset which results in account 411.10 showing a balance of $0.</span>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-6" id="fn-6" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="text-align:justify">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">For the year ended December 31, 2024 we recorded Debits to account 403.1 totaling $2,566 and Credits of the same amount to account 108.&#160; Additionally, we recorded Credits to account 403.1 totaling $2,566 and Debits of the same amount to account 182.3 in order to defer the total depreciation on the Asset Retirement Cost asset which results in account 403.1 showing a balance of $0.</span>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-7" id="fn-7" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="text-align:justify">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">For the year ended December 31, 2024 we recorded Debits to account 411.10 totaling $82,431 and Credits of the same amount to account 230.&#160; Additionally, we recorded Credits to account 411.10 totaling $82,431 and Debits of the same amount to account 182.3 in order to defer the total depreciation on the Asset Retirement Cost asset which results in account 411.10 showing a balance of $0.</span>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-8" id="fn-8" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="text-align:justify">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:115%">Our formula rate tariff includes the annual income tax cost or benefits due to permanent differences or differences between the amounts of expenses or revenues recognized in one period for ratemaking purposes and the amounts recognized for income tax purposes which do not reverse in one or more other periods, including the cost of income taxes on the Allowance for Other Funds Used During Construction ("AFUDC Equity"). Below identifies permanent differences associated with items included in the calculation of revenue requirement and depreciation expense associated with AFUDC Equity multiplied by the tax rate included on page 3 line 21 of our formula rate tariff to calculate the input used on page 3 line 24b of our formula rate tariff.</span>
      </div>
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="text-align:justify">
        <span>
          <br/>
        </span>
      </div>
